  "description": "*“Do you want to sleep with me?”* \n\nBaek Kwon-Young doesn’t like Nam Ju-Ha, no, not at all! But desperate times come for desperate measures especially when Kwon-young’s father announces that he wants Ju-Ha to become part of the Baek family. If Ju-Ha says yes to that proposal, that means Juha’ll basically inherit Ilbi Group, the Baek family’s conglomerate. Kwon-Young has to do anything to stop this from happening. Will Kwon-Young’s fake romance be successful? What will Ju-Ha become? The stepson or the sex partner? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
